 "name_en": "Make-to-Stock – Process Manufacturing Based on Production Order (2UG)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Make-to-Stock – Process Manufacturing Based on Production Order (2UG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables production planning in make-to-stock scenarios and quick reactions to incoming sales orders. The focus is on process manufacturing (supported through production orders).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process starts with the creation of a demand forecast for semifinished goods represented by planned independent requirements (PIRs). Based on PIRs, Material Requirements Planning (MRP) creates a production plan for semifinished goods and explodes the entire bill of material structure. As a result, raw material demand is planned.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Production planners can analyze and change the planned-order-based production plan manually.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Raw material demand leads to purchase requisitions that trigger alternative procurement scenarios referenced in this scope item.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The production process itself is entirely covered via conversion of planned into production orders, order release, direct material issue or backflush, confirmation of operations and goods receipt posting. Order-based target and actual costs are created, ensuring fully integrated material and value streams.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Process planned independent requirements</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform material requirements planning and evaluation of stock requirement list</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process production orders: Create production order, material staging, order release, order confirmation, material movement postings for goods issue and goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run scrap reports optionally after production</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Trigger production execution with a production plan</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Explode the bill of material automatically when running the material requirements planning</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve usability with intuitive confirmation of production operations</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>按库存生产 - 基于生产订单的流程制造 (2UG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持按库存生产场景中的生产计划以及对收到的销售订单的快速反应。重点是流程制造（通过生产订单支持）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程首先创建由计划独立需求 (PIR) 表示的半成品需求预测。基于 PIR，物料需求计划 (MRP) 为半成品创建生产计划并展开整个物料清单结构。因此，将计划原材料需求。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">生产计划员可以手动分析和更改基于计划订单的生产计划。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">原材料需求会导致触发此范围项目中引用的备选采购场景的采购申请。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过将计划订单转换为生产订单、订单下达、直接物料发货或反冲、工序确认和收货过账，将生产流程本身涵盖在内。创建基于订单的目标成本和实际成本，确保完全集成物料和价值流。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">处理计划独立需求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行物料需求计划和库存需求清单评估。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理生产订单：创建生产订单、备料、订单下达、订单确认、发货和收货的物料移动过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">生产后可选择运行报废报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio44be47d06253480ebf473f014457aa2d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过生产计划触发生产执行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行物料需求计划时，自动展开物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过直观的生产操作确认提高可用性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
